CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1786801685
OL,3,CSecond man jailed for stealing #62,000
OL,4,Cworth of Pokemon cards
OL,6,FA man who stole Pokemon cards to the
OL,7,Fvalue of #62,000 from a gaming shop
OL,8,Fhas been jailed, Cheshire Police have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FShane Johnson, 37, of no fixed abode,
OL,12,Fwas sentenced to 45 months and four
OL,13,Fweeks in prison at Birmingham Crown
OL,14,FCourt on Thursday 13 August after
OL,15,Fpleading guilty to burglary with
OL,16,Fintent to steal, the force said.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/7
