FL,362,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1786801685
OL,3,CSecond man jailed for stealing #62,000
OL,4,Cworth of Pokemon cards
OL,6,FHe joins his brother Keith Johnson,
OL,7,F33, from Birmingham, who was sentenced
OL,8,Fto 29 months in prison at the same
OL,9,Fcourt on 2 July after admitting the
OL,10,Fsame offences.
OL,12,FAccording to the force, the pair
OL,13,Ftargeted Celestial Collectables ` a
OL,14,Fshop which specialises in rare and
OL,15,Fhigh value Pokemon trading cards among
OL,16,Fother items ` in Warrington on the
OL,17,Fevening of 8 April this year.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
