OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,362,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1786801685
OL,3,CSecond man jailed for stealing #62,000
OL,4,Cworth of Pokemon cards
OL,6,FOfficers were alerted to the break-in
OL,7,Fafter reports that the shop door
OL,8,Fwindow was being smashed and the store
OL,9,Fwas being ransacked.
OL,11,FThe police entered the shop through
OL,12,Fthe broken door and discovered Pokemon
OL,13,Fcards "strewn across the floor", it
OL,14,Fsaid in a press release.
OL,16,FA crowbar used to smash the door
OL,17,Fwindow, shelving and cabinets was
OL,18,Frecovered from the scene by
OL,19,Finvestigators.
OL,26,@uD@GOUuD@_O]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
