OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,362,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1786801685
OL,3,CSecond man jailed for stealing #62,000
OL,4,Cworth of Pokemon cards
OL,6,FPokemon cards to the value of #62,000
OL,7,Fwere stolen and damage in excess of
OL,8,F#3,000 was caused to the shop.
OL,10,FThe force said CCTV revealed a white
OL,11,FFord transit van was used in the
OL,12,Fburglary, but the vehicle was on
OL,13,Fcloned number plates.
OL,15,FThe van, which travelled from
OL,16,FBirmingham to Warrington on the day of
OL,17,Fthe incident, had previously been
OL,18,Fcaptured parked outside Keith's
OL,19,Faddress.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,362,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1786801685
OL,3,CSecond man jailed for stealing #62,000
OL,4,Cworth of Pokemon cards
OL,6,FCCTV footage showed the van had broken
OL,7,Fdown in Warrington and the brothers
OL,8,Fhad to push it down one road onto
OL,9,Fanother, where there was another van
OL,10,Fwaiting which had travelled up from
OL,11,FBirmingham.
OL,13,FThe brothers transferred the stolen
OL,14,Fgoods into the other van, which was
OL,15,Flater found parked near Shane's
OL,16,Faddress, the police said.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,362,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1786801685
OL,3,CSecond man jailed for stealing #62,000
OL,4,Cworth of Pokemon cards
OL,6,FThe force said the brothers also used
OL,7,Fa crowbar to break into The Graded
OL,8,FGallery in Rugby and stole various
OL,9,Fitems, including Pokemon cards, before
OL,10,Fleaving in a Nissan X-Trail.
OL,12,FAccording to the force, the total
OL,13,Fstock stolen and damage caused was
OL,14,Fmore than #9,000.
OL,16,FThe two men were arrested and officers
OL,17,Fdiscovered stolen property belonging
OL,18,Fto Celestial Collectables, among other
OL,19,Fitems, at Keith's address.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
