OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,362,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1786801685
OL,3,CSecond man jailed for stealing #62,000
OL,4,Cworth of Pokemon cards
OL,6,FDC Hannah Smith said: "The
OL,7,Foverwhelming evidence collected
OL,8,Fthrough our extensive enquiries put
OL,9,Fthem at both crime scenes giving them
OL,10,Fno choice but to plead guilty.
OL,12,F"The brothers will now have to pay the
OL,13,Fprice for their part in their criminal
OL,14,FPokemon enterprise."
OL,26,@nD@WOUtD@AOUvD@TO]
